            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The laser jet printer use (color, office) is calculated according to the share between active (2 hrs/day), standby (7 hrs/day) and off (15 hrs/day) modes taken from literature information. The dataset includes the share of the printer production (assumed life span 4 years, running 240 days a year), the energy consumption for the different modes in the use-phase, the rail and road transport from factory to user, the paper and toner usage as well as the benzene emissions during 1 hour of printing.;
UUID: 0130a87a-840d-3f9f-9805-1fbfbc408c74</common:generalComment>
